# EC-004: Precipitation can shift a silver electrode without removing its metal
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 AgNO3 0.0001mol
add v1 Ag 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 AgNO3 0.0001mol
add v2 Ag 0.001mol
cell v1 v2
add v2 NaCl 0.0002mol
cell v1 v2
inspect
